  doers!\nThis year’s theme: The Rise of Personal Assistants: AI to Organ
 ize Your Life.\nFor decades\, software has made people do the work. Open t
 he app. Learn the workflow. Manage the tools.\nNow AI is starting to flip 
 that model.\nA new generation of personal assistants can understand contex
 t\, manage tasks\, and help people handle everyday life - from calendar ch
 aos and life admin to groceries\, travel planning\, and family logistics.\
 nAt this hackathon\, we want to see what builders create when AI can do mo
 re than…\n\nHosted by TechTO & 3 others
